Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:34:59 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 03/18] fix(scoring): persist round award in game state
 (awarded_to)

'Gets Points' state lived only in the host's browser, so a reload or re-selecting
a round re-enabled it and allowed double awards. The award (team + locked pot)
is now stored on the round and synced through the server.
